Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:29:17 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 036/371] tutorial: a brand-new pirate plays the opening with
 Jack Sparrow again

A new pirate never saw the jail cutscene: dev.prc skipped the tutorial,
force-tutorial-complete marked every pirate finished, and nothing on the
server started the first quest's scene.

- dev.prc: skip-tutorial off; force-tutorial-complete (HumanDNA.getTutorial,
  DistributedPlayerPirate.getTutorialState) now only applies to pirates past
  the Jolly Roger, which is every pirate made before this.
- Tutorial AI: on Act0 it gives Chapter1.rung1 and plays the jail scene;
  Make-A-Pirate and cannon practice send the events the next scenes wait on.
- QuestManagerAI: a cutscene always ends on quest-finalize (the old
  '<sendEvent>-<id>' never fired); the two tutorial waitEvents hold a scene;
  an object visit (Stumpy's boat) counts for a visit task.
- Login teleport does not send a new pirate out of the tutorial; a pirate
  still in the tutorial does not get the Chapter 2 opener.
- Client tutorial: Dan's scene starts once his quest arrives, the boat waits
  for the sea chest, a missing inventory no longer crashes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
